## Required changes

- `db-autoscaling-example`: `autoscaling` (not offered by `Managed PostgreSQL`)
- `db-zone-example`: `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Managed PostgreSQL`)
- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability` (not offered by `Cloud Servers`)

## Blockers

- `fn-example`: no offering in the `UpCloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
